      "statement": "WHEN a line is priced THE SYSTEM SHALL multiply the unit price by the quantity.\n\nExamples:\n  line_total(unit_price=4, quantity=3) => 12\n  line_total(unit_price=5, quantity=1) => 5",
      "status": "active",
